WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Safex

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.832
Jimmy was persuaded by Candy...

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:09.908
to become Mr. Cartwright's inheritor.

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:15.434
It seems that
Candy has found her own direction.

00:00:15.584 --> 00:00:19.507
The sound of leaving
is now echoing in her heart.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:26.920
The sob underneath the snow.

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:55.378
- Doctor Lenard.
- Hello Candy.

00:00:55.528 --> 00:00:58.079
How is Mr. Cartwright?

00:00:58.229 --> 00:01:01.820
I've just finished the examination,
he's about to be fully recovered.

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:03.820
That's great.

00:01:03.970 --> 00:01:07.661
Candy, I've something to deal with you.

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:09.260
With me?

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:13.100
You did a good job, while you were
looking after Mr. Cartwright.

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:16.062
Would you like to help me?

00:01:16.212 --> 00:01:17.833
- Help you?
- Yes.

00:01:17.983 --> 00:01:22.570
My wife is my nurse,
she has to return to her family.

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:25.008
Will you help me for one week?

00:01:25.158 --> 00:01:27.410
There's a salary, of course!

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:29.385
A salary for me?

00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:33.114
The milk
for the children of Pony's Home...

00:01:33.264 --> 00:01:36.354
Jimmy works for Mr. Cartwright
every day.

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:38.802
I can't stand by and do nothing.

00:01:38.952 --> 00:01:41.366
I have to prove my own ability.

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:43.900
Will you, Candy?

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:47.166
I'd love to, Doctor Lenard.

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:49.767
It's a promise?

00:01:49.917 --> 00:01:53.869
I need to ask first
sister Pony and sister Lane.

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:56.845
Let me go with you.

00:02:00.587 --> 00:02:05.213
Looking after the patients
is a good thing. I agree with that.

00:02:05.363 --> 00:02:06.616
Do your best, Candy!

00:02:06.766 --> 00:02:10.093
Thank you.
Sister Pony, sister Lane.

00:02:11.931 --> 00:02:16.561
Take a vow! Candy will serve
as my nurse and assistant.

00:02:16.936 --> 00:02:18.767
Yes, doctor.

00:02:31.251 --> 00:02:33.276
The first patient is over there.

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:47.259
How you feel today?

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:50.862
Doctor, I'm almost fully recovered.

00:02:51.012 --> 00:02:53.165
Healthier than a young man.

00:02:53.673 --> 00:02:55.099
This is...

00:02:55.249 --> 00:02:59.435
She serves as my assistant from today.

00:02:59.585 --> 00:03:01.878
I'm Candy. Nice to meet you.

00:03:04.918 --> 00:03:07.478
Let us start the examination.

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:10.095
Candy, the suitcase.

00:03:10.245 --> 00:03:12.453
Oh no! I left it on the carriage.

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:15.893
I am sorry, just a moment.

00:03:16.229 --> 00:03:18.322
Is that OK, Doctor?

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:25.464
Causing the patient's uneasiness,
I've failed.

00:03:35.081 --> 00:03:37.276
You won't need me anymore.

00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:40.550
Really? What good news!

00:03:42.655 --> 00:03:48.389
You can walk like a child. Don't worry!

00:03:51.998 --> 00:03:54.967
Don't push yourself too hard these days.

00:03:55.368 --> 00:03:57.199
Thank you!

00:03:58.071 --> 00:04:00.471
Watch your own body.

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:02.331
Take care of yourself.

00:04:02.481 --> 00:04:04.137
Do your best, Miss.

00:04:23.496 --> 00:04:26.226
Doctor, welcome back!

00:04:26.499 --> 00:04:30.936
Sorry to keep you waiting,
Let's start the examination.

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:35.230
Who is that girl?

00:04:40.446 --> 00:04:42.744
Put this on, Candy.

00:04:46.452 --> 00:04:50.010
Candy, give me a cup of coffee.

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:52.557
Come at once, doctor.

00:04:54.394 --> 00:04:55.786
First patient, please.

00:04:55.936 --> 00:04:57.658
Please, doctor.

00:05:01.834 --> 00:05:05.292
The doctor's work is very hard.

00:05:05.471 --> 00:05:07.364
It hurts! A bit lighter!

00:05:07.514 --> 00:05:09.771
Doctor, the coffee.

00:05:10.243 --> 00:05:12.677
Not now!

00:05:14.514 --> 00:05:16.744
Give me a hand now!

00:05:16.949 --> 00:05:18.940
Yes!

00:05:29.295 --> 00:05:31.889
-Harder!
-Yes!

00:05:34.801 --> 00:05:37.770
Look! This will hurt you a bit.
Please stand!

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.871
- Harder!
- Yes!

00:05:56.155 --> 00:05:57.747
OK, It's done.

00:06:02.829 --> 00:06:04.990
- Next patient.
- Yes!

00:06:06.566 --> 00:06:08.534
Next patient, please!

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:13.135
- Next.
- Yes!

00:06:16.542 --> 00:06:18.737
- Next.
- Yes!

00:06:24.517 --> 00:06:26.007
What's the matter with you?

00:06:32.191 --> 00:06:35.126
That's it!

00:06:38.164 --> 00:06:40.860
Good idea, Candy! Keep on!

00:06:53.079 --> 00:06:54.972
It's finished at last.

00:06:55.122 --> 00:06:57.272
Is it always like this every day?

00:06:57.422 --> 00:06:59.540
It's your first day, are you tired?

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:00.510
No!

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:05.044
There are patients in town,
is it fine with you?

00:07:05.194 --> 00:07:06.713
In town?

00:07:06.863 --> 00:07:10.350
You need to go out for examinations?

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:13.987
We are out of doctors and nurses.

00:07:14.137 --> 00:07:15.533
Nurses?

00:07:15.768 --> 00:07:21.294
The doctors have very urgent demand
to the nurses.

00:07:21.444 --> 00:07:23.602
It's a job with future.

00:07:24.143 --> 00:07:26.338
A job with future?

00:07:26.612 --> 00:07:29.308
You help me a lot.

00:07:30.249 --> 00:07:32.705
Do I really help?

00:07:32.855 --> 00:07:36.214
Certainly!
You helped that child, didn't you?

00:07:36.364 --> 00:07:41.083
No, I only try to comfort the patients.
That's it.

00:07:41.233 --> 00:07:44.526
Candy, may I have that cup of coffee?

00:07:44.797 --> 00:07:47.224
But... it's already cold by now.

00:07:47.374 --> 00:07:49.767
Doesn't matter, I'll take it.

00:08:12.358 --> 00:08:14.515
The street is crowded.

00:08:14.665 --> 00:08:17.356
There are diseases of civilization
in the city.

00:08:18.498 --> 00:08:19.986
diseases of civilization?

00:08:20.136 --> 00:08:24.661
People get more poverty
from the disease of civilization.

00:08:24.871 --> 00:08:27.169
It's same when conversely.

00:08:38.985 --> 00:08:41.681
He got the disease of richness.

00:08:43.556 --> 00:08:44.847
Disease of richness?

00:08:44.997 --> 00:08:46.614
Yes, the disease of richness.

00:08:46.764 --> 00:08:49.316
What you said is very unkind, doctor.

00:08:49.466 --> 00:08:50.916
I'm telling the truth.

00:08:51.066 --> 00:08:54.391
You don't like walking,
taking the car or carriage only.

00:08:54.541 --> 00:08:56.793
You eat too much and that made you fat.

00:08:56.943 --> 00:08:59.831
Your heart is now overloaded.

00:08:59.981 --> 00:09:01.978
So I ask you to help.

00:09:02.128 --> 00:09:05.114
- Join me for lunch.
- It is unnecessary.

00:09:05.264 --> 00:09:08.111
Doctor, have you had a meal today?

00:09:08.581 --> 00:09:12.017
We haven't had yet, right, Candy?

00:09:12.919 --> 00:09:15.644
Let me manage that,
Please make yourself at home.

00:09:15.794 --> 00:09:17.620
As you wish!

00:09:28.634 --> 00:09:32.297
Candy,
put the bread into the suitcase.

00:09:35.308 --> 00:09:37.538
- Hurry up.
- Yes!

00:10:00.199 --> 00:10:03.060
Doctor Lenard,
what would you do with the bread?

00:10:03.210 --> 00:10:04.460
Candy!

00:10:04.610 --> 00:10:09.129
People get more poverty
from the disease of civilization.

00:10:09.279 --> 00:10:12.904
Yes,
and also the disease of richness.

00:10:13.079 --> 00:10:17.941
That's right, on the other hand,
it produced the poverty too.

00:10:18.091 --> 00:10:20.552
These breads are prescriptions.

00:10:46.545 --> 00:10:49.105
Doctor Lenard!

00:10:52.652 --> 00:10:55.212
There are presents for everybody.

00:10:57.056 --> 00:10:58.044
Doctor Lenard.

00:10:58.194 --> 00:11:00.984
Well, Candy, take the breads out.

00:11:01.134 --> 00:11:03.493
Everybody, line up!

00:11:03.696 --> 00:11:05.088
Will you give me the present?

00:11:05.238 --> 00:11:09.395
That's right, everyone has their share.

00:11:09.902 --> 00:11:13.736
- Here.
- Thanks.

00:11:14.774 --> 00:11:18.403
Here.

00:11:19.211 --> 00:11:20.371
Here.

00:11:27.887 --> 00:11:29.442
To make you recover...

00:11:29.592 --> 00:11:30.914
I'll do the injection for you today.

00:11:31.064 --> 00:11:34.547
- Just a moment, doctor.
- What's the matter?

00:11:34.697 --> 00:11:38.221
The injection is expensive,
we have no money.

00:11:38.731 --> 00:11:41.856
He can bring me the money back
after his recovery.

00:11:42.006 --> 00:11:44.299
Don't worry about that!

00:11:44.503 --> 00:11:46.232
Doctor!

00:11:47.306 --> 00:11:49.433
Doctor Lenard.

00:11:53.612 --> 00:11:56.843
Get better as soon as possible.

00:11:57.116 --> 00:11:59.311
Thank you!

00:12:14.767 --> 00:12:16.997
Strange! This is...

00:12:22.608 --> 00:12:24.735
A message from a patient?

00:12:25.044 --> 00:12:28.872
The baby is going to be born,
please! Woody.

00:12:29.022 --> 00:12:31.279
The woodcutter, Woody?

00:12:31.751 --> 00:12:34.049
It's snowing in the mountain.

00:12:34.887 --> 00:12:36.814
Doctor Lenard, what should we do?

00:12:36.964 --> 00:12:38.890
I have to go there, of course.

00:12:39.325 --> 00:12:42.748
You can't take the risk,
wait here for me.

00:12:42.898 --> 00:12:45.057
Please take me with you.

00:12:45.364 --> 00:12:47.690
No way,
It's dangerous in the mountains.

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:49.791
It's same to the doctor.

00:12:51.537 --> 00:12:54.628
I am a doctor,
it is my work to rescue people.

00:12:54.778 --> 00:12:59.507
I am a nurse,
I have to finish my work.

00:13:06.886 --> 00:13:12.324
Candy, you will be a good nurse someday.

00:13:12.858 --> 00:13:14.416
Yes!

00:13:29.074 --> 00:13:31.941
The doctor adheres to his own faith.

00:13:32.444 --> 00:13:37.381
Even risking his life.
He is a brave man.

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:45.257
I left the St. Paul academy
to find my own direction.

00:13:46.525 --> 00:13:48.652
I went through all kinds of difficulty.

00:13:52.231 --> 00:13:56.031
I still can't find my own direction yet.

00:14:04.944 --> 00:14:08.277
I'm sleepy.

00:14:08.581 --> 00:14:11.345
Candy, don't sleep!

00:14:14.153 --> 00:14:16.383
Candy, wake up!

00:14:16.589 --> 00:14:18.015
Okay!

00:14:18.165 --> 00:14:21.752
Candy, be as a competent nurse.

00:14:23.896 --> 00:14:26.990
Candy,
have you heard about Miss Nightingale?

00:14:27.266 --> 00:14:28.824
Only the name.

00:14:29.301 --> 00:14:36.070
Nightingale is a British woman,
with kindness and capability.

00:14:36.709 --> 00:14:39.367
It was the war of Crimea.

00:14:39.517 --> 00:14:41.771
She went to the front line.

00:14:41.921 --> 00:14:44.140
Both the enemy and British soldier.

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:46.441
She looked after the wounded heartedly.

00:14:46.591 --> 00:14:50.008
After the war,
she graduated from the nursing school.

00:14:50.158 --> 00:14:52.682
She established the open ward.

00:14:58.097 --> 00:15:00.725
Nursing school, open ward.

00:15:01.467 --> 00:15:04.561
There are such remarkable women
in the world!

00:15:05.337 --> 00:15:09.865
Therefore,
you must not surrender to the storm.

00:15:10.242 --> 00:15:11.539
Yes!

00:15:25.925 --> 00:15:27.818
The road is obstructed.
We must go by foot!

00:15:27.968 --> 00:15:29.690
Yes!

00:15:46.178 --> 00:15:48.305
Do your best!

00:15:55.054 --> 00:15:57.921
It's snowing out there,
will the doctor come?

00:15:58.891 --> 00:16:00.620
God!

00:16:04.530 --> 00:16:05.929
Doctor.

00:16:11.103 --> 00:16:13.799
- Doctor!
- Sorry, I am late.

00:17:52.538 --> 00:17:54.005
It's born.

00:17:54.373 --> 00:17:55.670
It's born.

00:17:59.344 --> 00:18:03.239
Come! Candy, embrace the new life.

00:18:03.389 --> 00:18:04.815
Yes!

00:18:15.527 --> 00:18:17.859
Show him to the father.

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:20.059
Yes!

00:18:24.803 --> 00:18:26.771
It's my...

00:18:29.475 --> 00:18:32.802
-It is a boy.
-Thank God!

00:18:32.952 --> 00:18:36.278
Congratulations! Mr. Woody.

00:18:37.116 --> 00:18:39.414
Thank you!

00:18:46.825 --> 00:18:50.220
I am so happy, so moved.

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:53.730
People's life is precious.

00:18:54.066 --> 00:18:57.627
It's our honor to participate in it.

00:18:58.770 --> 00:19:01.631
Very...

00:19:01.781 --> 00:19:06.177
Candy, are you trying to melt the snow
with those tears?

00:19:06.745 --> 00:19:09.009
I just can't help it.

00:19:09.915 --> 00:19:12.145
Let's go!

00:19:28.233 --> 00:19:32.494
Candy, doctor Lenard have told us
about everything you did.

00:19:32.644 --> 00:19:34.464
You're doing well, Candy!

00:19:34.614 --> 00:19:37.508
Doctor Lenard praises you very much.

00:19:37.776 --> 00:19:41.435
No, I have lot of things to learn yet.

00:19:41.585 --> 00:19:45.504
I told sister Lane once...

00:19:45.654 --> 00:19:49.610
You work so hard just like us.

00:19:51.323 --> 00:19:57.819
Candy, you told us before that you want
to take care of the children like us.

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:01.190
Sister Pony, sister Lane.

00:20:02.601 --> 00:20:04.796
What's the matter, Candy?

00:20:05.070 --> 00:20:08.597
I have found my own direction.

00:20:09.608 --> 00:20:12.406
I want to be a nurse.

00:20:13.011 --> 00:20:15.275
- A nurse?
- Yes!

00:20:16.715 --> 00:20:21.207
Candy, It's not easy to be a nurse.

00:20:21.357 --> 00:20:24.653
I know! So I need your help!

00:20:42.941 --> 00:20:46.900
I have found my own way!

00:20:47.179 --> 00:20:49.837
Marry Jane Nurse Training School.

00:20:49.987 --> 00:20:52.781
You can study there.

00:20:52.985 --> 00:20:56.211
Candy,
if you really made your decision...

00:20:56.361 --> 00:21:00.930
I'll write you a recommendation
when spring comes...

00:21:01.080 --> 00:21:05.152
The headmaster is an old friend of mine.

00:21:05.302 --> 00:21:07.055
Marry Jane Nurse Training School.

00:21:07.205 --> 00:21:08.928
I can't wait to be there.

00:21:11.637 --> 00:21:16.506
Candy is now expecting for the spring.
